      <CodeBlock code={"$ oc get networkpolicy"} lang="terminal" />
      <p>Expected output:</p>
      <CodeBlock code={"NAME                           POD-SELECTOR   AGE\nallow-from-openshift-ingress   <none>         7s\nallow-from-same-namespace      <none>         7s"} lang="terminal" />
      </li>
      </ol>
      </li>
      </ol>
